X: 1
T: Suppertime
O: Alan Menken, 1982
N: The plant's blues from Little Shop of Horrors. Melody (channel 0) of a
N: hamienet.com MIDI (id 7950), moved up a tone from G minor to A minor so the
N: range fits the recorder; chords fitted from the MIDI's vamp and bass (F7 to
N: Am7 riff cycle, Dm7 answers, the Fm7 borrow). One pass: the riff verses with
N: their answer rests, the swinging connector and the lazy "suppertime" hook
N: with its close (source bars 5-13, 25-38, 45-49). The swung eighths and the
N: dotted hook rhythm are straightened; pitches are the source's.
